From: richie-rich90454 <rjian880@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0008/0014] Open VSX marketplace

Points the extension gallery at Open VSX so no Microsoft marketplace endpoint is
reachable, including the Live Share entry (0006 has no OSS code to remove).

Rebased onto upstream 1.137.0; same extensionsGallery block, added ahead of
builtInExtensionsEnabledWithAutoUpdates.

Verification: ide/tests/patch-smoke.sh (0008-gallery)

---
diff --git a/product.json b/product.json
index 23f81339..34b3c8eb 100644
--- a/product.json
+++ b/product.json
@@ -242,6 +242,12 @@
 			"type": "light"
 		}
 	],
+	"extensionsGallery": {
+		"serviceUrl": "https://open-vsx.org/vscode/gallery",
+		"itemUrl": "https://open-vsx.org/vscode/item",
+		"resourceUrlTemplate": "https://open-vsx.org/vscode/asset/{publisher}/{name}/{version}/Microsoft.VisualStudio.Code.WebResources/extension",
+		"extensionUrlTemplate": "https://open-vsx.org/vscode/asset/{publisher}/{name}/{version}/Microsoft.VisualStudio.Code.WebResources/extension"
+	},
 	"builtInExtensionsEnabledWithAutoUpdates": [
 		"GitHub.copilot-chat"
 	],
